(Software Requirements Specification ? ShopSphere E-Commerce Platform) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Introduction) Tj
T*
(This document specifies the requirements for the ShopSphere e-commerce platform. It is intended) Tj
T*
(for the development, quality assurance and operations teams.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Account Management) Tj
T*
(R001: The system shall allow new users to create an account using an email address and a) Tj
T*
(password.) Tj
T*
(R002: The system shall allow registered users to log in using their email address and password.) Tj
T*
(R003: The system shall allow users to log in using their mobile number and password only.) Tj
T*
(R004: The system shall allow a user to reset a forgotten password through a password reset) Tj
T*
(link.) Tj
T*
(R005: The system shall lock a user account after five consecutive failed login attempts.) Tj
T*
(R006: The system shall send notifications.) Tj
T*
(R007: The system shall allow users to update their profile information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Product Catalogue) Tj
T*
(R008: The system shall display a catalogue of products with name, price, description and) Tj
T*
(availability.) Tj
T*
(R009: The system shall allow customers to search for products by keyword.) Tj
T*
(R010: The system shall allow customers to filter search results by category, price range and) Tj
T*
(rating.) Tj
T*
(R011: Search results shall be returned quickly.) Tj
T*
(R012: The system shall display product reviews submitted by verified purchasers.) Tj
T*
(R013: The system shall support at least 50,000 product listings.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Shopping Cart and Checkout) Tj
T*
(R014: The system shall allow a logged-in customer to add products to a shopping cart.) Tj
T*
(R015: The system shall allow a customer to remove products from the shopping cart.) Tj
T*
(R016: The system shall calculate the cart total including applicable taxes and shipping) Tj
T*
(charges.) Tj
T*
(R017: The system shall allow customers to register for an account.) Tj
T*
(R018: The system shall allow customers to complete a purchase using the checkout process.) Tj
T*
(R019: Guest checkout is not allowed; all purchases require a registered account.) Tj
T*
(R020: The system shall allow users to check out without creating an account.) Tj
T*
(R021: The system shall support payment by credit card, debit card and digital wallet.) Tj
T*
(R022: The system shall send an order confirmation email after a successful purchase.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Order Management) Tj
T*
(R023: The system shall allow customers to view their order history.) Tj
T*
(R024: The system shall allow customers to track the delivery status of a placed order.) Tj
T*
(R025: The system shall allow customers to cancel an order before it has been shipped.) Tj
T*
(R026: The application shall respond quickly to user requests.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
