(R027: The system shall allow administrators to update the status of an order.) Tj
T*
(R028: Refunds shall be processed in a reasonable time frame.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Administration) Tj
T*
(R029: The system shall allow administrators to add, edit and remove product listings.) Tj
T*
(R030: The system shall allow administrators to view sales reports.) Tj
T*
(R031: The system shall provide an appropriate level of access control for administrative) Tj
T*
(functions.) Tj
T*
(R032: The system shall record an audit log of all administrative actions.) Tj
T*
(R033: The system shall allow administrators to manage user accounts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Security) Tj
T*
(R034: The system shall encrypt all stored customer passwords.) Tj
T*
(R035: All data transmitted between the client and the server shall be encrypted using TLS 1.2) Tj
T*
(or higher.) Tj
T*
(R036: The system shall be secure against common web vulnerabilities.) Tj
T*
(R037: The system shall require multi-factor authentication for all administrator accounts.) Tj
T*
(R038: Administrators shall be able to sign in with only a username and password.) Tj
T*
(R039: Customer payment card details shall not be stored on the platform's own servers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Performance and Availability) Tj
T*
(R040: The system shall support at least 5,000 concurrent users without degradation of service.) Tj
T*
(R041: The system should be fast during normal usage.) Tj
T*
(R042: The checkout process shall complete within 3 seconds for 95% of transactions under normal) Tj
T*
(operating conditions.) Tj
T*
(R043: The platform shall maintain 99.9% uptime measured monthly.) Tj
T*
(R044: The system shall be easy to use.) Tj
T*
(R045: The system shall scale to handle large traffic volumes during sale events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Reporting and Analytics) Tj
T*
(R046: The system shall generate a daily sales summary report for administrators.) Tj
T*
(R047: The system shall allow administrators to export reports.) Tj
T*
(R048: The system shall track product page views for analytics purposes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
